# EV电池平台API测试脚本
# 使用VS Code REST Client插件或curl命令测试

### 1. 用户登录测试
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 用户注册测试
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "123456",
  "email": "newuser@ev.com",
  "realName": "新用户"
}

### 3. 获取当前用户信息（需要先登录获取token）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/user/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 修改密码
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 5. 测试用户登录
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 6. 采购用户登录
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "buyer01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 7. 销售用户登录
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seller01",
  "password": "123456"
}